{"page":408,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:33","surah":30,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا مَسَّ ٱلنَّاسَ ضُرٌّ دَعَوْا۟ رَبَّهُم مُّنِيبِينَ إِلَيْهِ ثُمَّ إِذَآ أَذَاقَهُم مِّنْهُ رَحْمَةً إِذَا فَرِيقٌ مِّنْهُم بِرَبِّهِمْ يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When something bad happens to people, they cry to their Lord and turn to Him for help, but no sooner does He let them taste His blessing than- lo and behold!- some of them ascribe partners to their Lord,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَسَّ","en_gloss":"touches","transliteration":"massa","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"people","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ضُرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"hardship","transliteration":"ḍurrun","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دَعَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they call","transliteration":"daʿaw","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبَّهُم","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُّنِيبِينَ","en_gloss":"turning","transliteration":"munībīna","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذَآ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَذَاقَهُم","en_gloss":"He causes them to taste","transliteration":"adhāqahum","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنْهُ","en_gloss":"from Him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَحْمَةً","en_gloss":"Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَرِيقٌۭ","en_gloss":"A party","transliteration":"farīqun","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنْهُم","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their Lord","transliteration":"birabbihim","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"associate partners","transliteration":"yush'rikūna","verse_key":"30:33"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:33"}]},{"verse_key":"30:34","surah":30,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟ بِمَآ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟ فَسَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"showing no gratitude for what We have given them. ‘Take your pleasure! You will come to know.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَكْفُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"So as to deny","transliteration":"liyakfurū","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"[in] what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"We have granted them","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَتَمَتَّعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Then enjoy","transliteration":"fatamattaʿū","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","en_gloss":"but soon","transliteration":"fasawfa","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"you will know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"30:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:34"}]},{"verse_key":"30:35","surah":30,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ سُلْطَـٰنًا فَهُوَ يَتَكَلَّمُ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Did We send them down any authority that sanctions the partners they ascribe to God?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"30:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"have We sent","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"30:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"30:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"an authority","transliteration":"sul'ṭānan","verse_key":"30:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and it","transliteration":