"en_gloss":"have sent forth","transliteration":"qaddamat","verse_key":"30:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"30:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"30:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"They","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"30:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَقْنَطُونَ","en_gloss":"despair","transliteration":"yaqnaṭūna","verse_key":"30:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:36"}]},{"verse_key":"30:37","surah":30,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَبْسُطُ ٱلرِّزْقَ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not see that God gives abundantly to whoever He will and sparingly [to whoever He will]? There truly are signs in this for those who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَبْسُطُ","en_gloss":"extends","transliteration":"yabsuṭu","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","en_gloss":"the provision","transliteration":"l-riz'qa","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"for whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and straitens (it)","transliteration":"wayaqdiru","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","translite