"}]},{"verse_key":"30:41","surah":30,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"ظَهَرَ ٱلْفَسَادُ فِى ٱلْبَرِّ وَٱلْبَحْرِ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ أَيْدِى ٱلنَّاسِ لِيُذِيقَهُم بَعْضَ ٱلَّذِى عَمِلُوا۟ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Corruption has flourished on land and sea as a result of people’s actions and He will make them taste the consequences of some of their own actions so that they may turn back.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ظَهَرَ","en_gloss":"Has appeared","transliteration":"ẓahara","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْفَسَادُ","en_gloss":"the corruption","transliteration":"l-fasādu","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْبَرِّ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-bari","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"and the sea","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَسَبَتْ","en_gloss":"have earned","transliteration":"kasabat","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيْدِى","en_gloss":"(the) hands","transliteration":"aydī","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِيُذِيقَهُم","en_gloss":"so that He may let them taste","transliteration":"liyudhīqahum","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْضَ","en_gloss":"a part","transliteration":"baʿḍa","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) that which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they have done","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَرْجِعُونَ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","verse_key":"30:41"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤١","en_gloss":"(41)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:41"}]}]}